Version: svn55471
License: LPPL-1.3c
Requires: texlive-base texlive-kpathsea
Provides: tex(abnt.sty) = %{tl_version}

%description abnt
The ABNT package provides a clean and practical implementation
of the ABNT rules for academic texts. Its purpose is to be as
