Provides: tex(pst-dart.tex) = %{tl_version}

%description pst-dart
pst-dart is a PSTricks related package and draws Dart Boards.
Optional arguments are the unit and the fontsize.

%package pst-spinner
Summary: Drawing a fidget spinner
Version: svn66115
License: LPPL-1.3c
