# make opentype fontdir symlinks
# The following fonts exist in Fedora (and would conflict or duplicate in the fc-cache
# if we make their symlinks) as of: 2020-05-14
# adf-accanthis-fonts | texlive-accanthis
# adf-gillius-fonts | texlive-gillius
# abattis-cantarell-fonts | texlive-cantarell
# google-roboto-fonts | texlive-roboto
